Package: ppgw-config
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: curimit <curimit@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: ppgw-system
Description: Per-deployment configuration for PaoPao Gateway
 Generated by make-seed.sh from the plain-text ppgw.conf on the seed
 ISO. Applies login (SSH key / password), optional static network and
 the optional local /www/ppgw.ini. This is the only package that varies
 between deployments; it is never shipped in the bare-metal tarball.
